        <h2 style="margin:0;"><span class="gh-docs-num" style="background:#238636; color:#fff;">⭐️</span> الدفع بالرموز الشخصية (Personal Access Token)</h2>
        <span style="background:rgba(56,139,253,0.15); color:var(--gh-accent-fg); border:1px solid rgba(56,139,253,0.4); font-size:.78rem; font-weight:700; padding:.2rem .6rem; border-radius:12px;">موصى به للأمان و CI/CD</span>
